   342	## A10.4 Authority capture: honest signed material protected; publication remains an issuer duty; key substitution — RECOMMENDED (owner; option (e) also Codex), NARROW-CLAIM and, under option (e), BROADEN, AWAITING AUTHOR RULING (review A04)
   343	
