   101	| U minus first-seen(h) (U computed as max nTime(h … h+5) + 7200) | minimum 6,135.1 s; median 9,908.3 s |
   102	| X − 7200 = max nTime(h … h+5) − nTime(h) | median 2,727 s; 99th percentile 6,899 s |
